// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/site/landing_ru.t27 -- the Russian landing page of t27.ai, https://t27.ai/ru/. Source of truth for
; public/ru/index.html (gHashTag/trinity, issue Trinity-S-AI-DNA/trinity#1902): t27c gen-text compiles this
; file and runs page_landing_ru, whose bytes the workflow .github/workflows/emit-widget-pages.yml writes to
; that path. The page has NO script: a dark glass top navigation, a hero, and four sections of cards
; (lessons, articles, results, about), then a footer. HTML and CSS appear only as string constants and
; as bytes written by the functions below; nothing on the page is typed by hand.
; --
; LANGUAGE. By the owner's decision of 2026-11-19 this one file carries Cyrillic, inside string literals
; only (the same exception as specs/course_recipe/fragments/agent-ru.t27). Identifiers, comments and the
; module line stay ASCII English. The motto words are the ru block of src/lib/motto.ts; the hero lede is
; the ru lede of src/components/GameHero.tsx; the course titles come from i18n/<id>.ru.json; the article
; titles are the ru titles of src/data/blog/index.ts. A page that states no number the site does not state.
; --
; LINKS. A route of the app is written /?lang=ru#/route, so the app opens in Russian. A card is one anchor.
; The courses are the COURSE_IDS of specs/course/courses.t27 in the same order.
; --
; The writer is views/html_out.t27 and the head helper is views/page_kit.t27 (pk_meta, pk_count, pk_has).
; This module mentions every html_out name it needs in lr_anchor, because the splicer follows only the
; names a module itself mentions (see html_out.t27).
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module site_landing_ru;

use widgets::views::html_out;
use widgets::views::page_kit;

